// Windows resource script — bound into the `window` binary by
// `build.rs` (via `embed-resource`) so File Explorer, the taskbar,
// Alt-Tab, and the OS's window-icon API all surface the CodeScope
// brand mark. Mirrors the C# build's `<ApplicationIcon>` in
// `CodeScope.App.csproj`. Resource ID `1` is the convention Windows
// uses to find "the" application icon.
1 ICON "codescope.ico"
